<title>HUNGARY: HUMAN TO BUY 20,000 OWN SHARES.</title>
<headline>HUMAN TO BUY 20,000 OWN SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian pharmaceuticals company Human Rt announced on Tuesday that it had given an order (to a brokerage) for the purchase of 20,000 own shares via the bourse.</p>
<p>Human did not give further details.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
